(01. Leave and Attendance Policy | Effective Date: 2026-01-01) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Notice: This is synthetic demonstration data, not a real company policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1: Annual Leave Entitlement) Tj T*
(- Full-time employees accrue 20 paid annual leave days per calendar year) Tj T*
(  \(1.67 days accrued per completed month of service\).) Tj T*
(- Up to 5 unused annual leave days may carry over into Q1 \(until March 31\)) Tj T*
(  of the following calendar year; days beyond 5 expire unless local law applies.) Tj T*
(- Leave requests of 1 to 3 consecutive days require 5 business days notice.) Tj T*
(- Leave requests of 4 or more days require 15 business days advance notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2: Sick Leave and Medical Certification) Tj T*
(- Employees receive 10 paid sick leave days per calendar year.) Tj T*
(- Medical certification from a licensed practitioner is required for any sick) Tj T*
(  leave absence exceeding 3 consecutive working days.) Tj T*
