(Section 3: Parental Leave) Tj T*
(- Primary caregivers are eligible for 16 weeks of paid parental leave after) Tj T*
(  completing 6 months of continuous employment.) Tj T*
(- Secondary caregivers receive 4 weeks of paid parental leave under the same) Tj T*
(  6-month tenure eligibility rule.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4: Core Working Hours and Office Attendance) Tj T*
(- Standard working hours are 40 hours per week, Monday through Friday.) Tj T*
(- Mandatory core collaboration hours are 10:00 to 16:00 local office time.) Tj T*
(- Employees working on-site must badge in at the office desk by 10:15.) Tj T*
(- Exception: For approved remote days, Section 4 of the Remote and Hybrid) Tj T*
(  Work Policy overrides the physical office badge check-in requirement.) Tj T*
